title: AWS DynamoDB Table
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS DynamoDB table metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into table capacity, throttling, and performance.

 Monitored metrics:

 - Consumed Read/Write Capacity Units: Actual capacity consumption

 - Read/Write Throttle Events: Throttling occurrences (critical for capacity planning)

 - Successful Request Latency: Average latency in milliseconds

 - User/System Errors: Error counts with appropriate severity

 - Provisioned Read/Write Capacity: Configured capacity units

 Thresholds can be configured for capacity consumption, throttle events,
 and request latency.

discovery:
 One service is created for each DynamoDB table discovered.
